	(text "PWR_FLAG: this rail has no power_out pin anywhere on it, so ERC\ncannot see what drives it. The flag says a source is off-sheet.\nA rail a regulator drives does NOT get one."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c425d705-0b21-59ec-8354-443bbf5294cd")
	)
	(text "Body IMU, rev A. The second of the two inertial sensors: the hat's LSM6DSV16X is the head, this one is the body. SA0 to GND makes it 0x6A\nso both sit on the hat's 3.3 V CCI0 bus, which reaches here on a 4-wire JST-SH cable from the hat's J12."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 163.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6d27edf6-fc0d-53c2-a9c5-0fff86f15bda")
	)
